 style="text-align: center;"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">感谢格雷！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;啊啊啊啊猛男画风！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/prrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr/www" alt="www" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/prrrrrrrrrrrrr/galaaaa" alt="galaaaa" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;">感谢<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6126100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610026640" alt="Dr Aurora Owl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6126100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" >Dr Aurora Owl</a></span>gala！粉粉嫩嫩谁不爱ww</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">感谢门罗老师！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;超超超超级喜欢的像素画！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/monroesart/62D3BAD0-D703-49A9-B14A-7F42C7BC1DA6.png" alt="62D3BAD0-D703-49A9-B14A-7F42C7BC1DA6.png" class="image" /> <p style="text-align: center;">感谢<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/monroe-products" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4715842&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610026640" alt="Monroe Products" style="background-image:url(http:/