						 date: '20██/██/██ ██:██, 地点：Site-CN-██'<br /> content: &quot;[[div class=\&quot;textchange\&quot;]]\n[[module ListUsers users=\&quot;.\&quot;]]\n[[div class=\&quot;sitemember\&quot;]]\n“你听说了没，最近咱们站点要换新主管了！希望他不会跟现在这个一样混蛋。”研究员S.Logic笑着说。\n\n“主管还没走呢，你就这样说……怕不是想作死……”<span style="color: balck">%%name%%</span>翻了个白眼。\n\n“不要在意这些细节啦，总之……”\n\n<strong>声音戛然而止。</strong>\n\n朝夕相处的同事，挚友，知己，兄弟，S.Logic，刹那间消逝为一团光点，消失不见。\n\n“这是第几个？”<span style="color: balck">%%name%%</span>注视着Logic消失的方向，仿佛在呓语。\n\n“他们到底干什么去了？”<span style="color: balck">%%name%%</span>想着。\n\n70年后，重症监护室里，年已过百的<span style="color: balck">%%name%%</span>在他濒临死亡的时候，脑海里只剩下一句话。\n\n“他们到底干什么去了？”\n\n<span style="color: balck">%%name%%</span>的呼吸愈发急促，泪珠在眼里打转。\n\n泪光中，他看到研究员S.Logic，看到特工罗青，看到主管陈航，看到那些在无声中消逝为光点的挚友们。\n\n“<span style="color: balck">%%name%%</span> 移除成员资格。”\n\n<span style="color: balck">%%name%%</span>的耳边似乎响起了这样一句话。\n\n他想不明白这是什么意思，他也没时间去想。\n\n因为就在此时，曾经的研究员<span style="color: balck">%%name%%</span>，已经化作光点，消失得不留半点痕迹，仿佛并没有在这个下层叙事里存在过。\n[<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/div]]/n[[/module]]/n[[div">class=\&quot;sitemember\&quot;</a>]\n[<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/div]]/n[[/div]]/n[[module">CSS</a>]\n.textchange div.sitemember:nth-child(2) {\n display:none;\n}\n[[/module]]&quot;<br /> comments: &quot; <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>\n\n请使用以下格式添加评论：\n&gt; <strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tenno-215" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6704451&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610026641" alt="tenno-215" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6704451)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tenno-215" >tenno-215</a></span>：</strong>所以那几个人名是真人真事吗\n&gt; <strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/misaya1" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5393648&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610026641" alt="Misaya1" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5393648)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/misaya1" >Misaya1</a></span>：</strong>这个显示读者ID的代码不分大小写呀\n&gt; <strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/northstreet" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6271969&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610026641" alt="Northstreet" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6271969)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/northstreet" >Northstreet</a></span></strong>：呃……我耳边突然有了一个<strong>声音</strong>？\n\n\n\n</p> </div> </div> </div> &quot; <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lqttty" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6736502&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610026641" alt="lqttty" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6736502)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lqttty" >lqttty</a></span></p> 
