&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3624&quot;&gt;SCP-3624&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-3625 | &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3626&quot;&gt;SCP-3626&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
